<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Stocks-Markets-Economic Times</title><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks</link><description><![CDATA[Stock Market News: Latest Stock news and updates on The Economic Times. Find Stock Market Live Updates, BSE, NSE Top Gainers, Losers and more.]]> </description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:09:31 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/2146842.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) 2026 Bennett Coleman and Co. Ltd, http://info.indiatimes.com/terms/tou.html</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>Economic Times</title><url>https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-76939477,width-600,height-60/economictimes.jpg</url><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[India’s rupee has become an accidental carry star]]> </title><description><![CDATA[The Reserve Bank of India has made moves that temporarily attract carry traders to the rupee. Recent factors include decreasing oil prices and a shift in foreign investment from artificial intelligence stocks to Indian markets. However, these RBI incentives may not last, leaving uncertainty for traders. India's interest rate advantage has significantly diminished since 2011, raising concerns. Policymakers face challenges in ensuring sustained interest in the rupee amid historical depreciation.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/indias-rupee-has-become-an-accidental-carry-star/articleshow/136117132.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136117132,imgsize-288542.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/indias-rupee-has-become-an-accidental-carry-star/articleshow/136117132.cms</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:13:12 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[NSEL releases Rs 1,950 crore in one-time settlement, ends 14-year payment default]]> </title><description><![CDATA[The National Spot Exchange Ltd has revealed a substantial settlement payout of Rs 1,950 crore to eligible claimants, marking the end of a lengthy 14-year legal battle stemming from a Rs 5,600 crore payment crisis. This settlement received the green light from the Mumbai bench of the National Company Law Tribunal, buoyed by considerable backing from claimants.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/nsel-releases-rs-1950-crore-in-one-time-settlement-ends-14-year-payment-default/articleshow/136104164.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136104164,imgsize-31674.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/nsel-releases-rs-1950-crore-in-one-time-settlement-ends-14-year-payment-default/articleshow/136104164.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:43:56 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Adani Airport raises $300 mn from 360 ONE Asset, taking total equity infusion to $1.35 bn]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Adani Airport Holdings Ltd will raise USD 300 million to enhance its presence in India's aviation sector. This investment will contribute to its target of increasing passenger capacity from 96 million to 200 million. The company operates eight airports, handling about 95.3 million passengers in the last fiscal year. The funds will support modernizing existing infrastructure and developing airport cities for commercial activities.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/adani-airport-raises-300-mn-from-360-one-asset-taking-total-equity-infusion-to-1-35-bn/articleshow/136104118.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136104118,imgsize-71232.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/adani-airport-raises-300-mn-from-360-one-asset-taking-total-equity-infusion-to-1-35-bn/articleshow/136104118.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:41:12 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Cipla Share Price Live Updates: Cipla Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/cipla-stock-price-live-updates-23-nov-2026/liveblog/136092588.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136092588,imgsize-6302.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/cipla-stock-price-live-updates-23-nov-2026/liveblog/136092588.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:20:09 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[JSW Steel Share Price Live Updates: JSW Steel Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/jsw-steel-stock-price-today-live-23-nov-2026/liveblog/136092567.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136092567,imgsize-127828.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/jsw-steel-stock-price-today-live-23-nov-2026/liveblog/136092567.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:19:43 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jio Financial Services Share Price Live Updates: Jio Financial Services Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/jio-financial-services-share-price-today-live-updates-23-nov-2026/liveblog/136092528.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136092528,imgsize-7310.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/jio-financial-services-share-price-today-live-updates-23-nov-2026/liveblog/136092528.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov